<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title || 'Download Edutrack Apps' %></title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #10231c;
            --muted: #62756d;
            --green: #06996b;
            --green-deep: #037252;
            --green-dark: #064f3d;
            --green-soft: #eaf8f2;
            --line: #d7e6df;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --soft: #f5faf8;
            --danger: #df3f3f;
            --shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.18);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        a { color: inherit; }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            color: #ffffff;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 86% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.16) 0 130px, transparent 132px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #08ad78 0%, #07875f 56%, #056447 100%);
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: -8vw;
            right: -8vw;
            bottom: -125px;
            height: 270px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
            transform: rotate(-3deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 18px 34px rgba(6, 114, 82, 0.08);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .wrap {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .brand-bar {
            min-height: 88px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .brand img {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 3px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(5, 79, 61, 0.22);
        }

        .brand strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .brand span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.82fr 1fr;
            gap: clamp(34px, 6vw, 84px);
            align-items: center;
            padding: 36px 0 150px;
        }

        .phone-shell {
            width: min(332px, 92vw);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 36px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .phone-screen {
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #dce8e3;
            border-radius: 28px;
            background: #f7fbf9;
            min-height: 560px;
        }

        .phone-header {
            padding: 18px 18px 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #09a874 0%, #078a62 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .phone-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .phone-brand img {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 2px;
        }

        .phone-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .phone-subtitle {
            margin-top: 2px;
            font-size: 11px;
            opacity: 0.88;
        }

        .phone-chip-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        .phone-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            min-height: 28px;
            padding: 0 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .live-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ff3f3f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(255, 63, 63, 0.16);
        }

        .phone-body {
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .greeting-card,
        .summary-card,
        .alert-card,
        .weekly-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.06);
        }

        .greeting-card {
            padding: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .greeting-card small {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .greeting-card strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .summary-card {
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .ring {
            width: 122px;
            height: 122px;
            margin: 0 auto 15px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: conic-gradient(#0aa16f 0 var(--rate), #d7f2e7 var(--rate) 100%);
        }

        .ring span {
            width: 86px;
            height: 86px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #071a14;
            font-size: 27px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .mini-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .mini-stat {
            min-height: 68px;
            padding: 11px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f1f6f4;
        }

        .mini-stat b {
            display: block;
            color: #071a14;
            font-size: 22px;
            line-height: 1.05;
        }

        .mini-stat span {
            color: #53665f;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .alert-card {
            padding: 13px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .alert-icon {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #fff0f0;
            color: var(--danger);
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .alert-card strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .alert-card span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 2px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .weekly-card {
            padding: 13px;
        }

        .weekly-title {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .bars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 7px;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .day {
            min-height: 88px;
            display: grid;
            justify-items: center;
            align-items: end;
            padding: 7px 4px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f7faf8;
            color: #53665f;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .day i {
            width: 22px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #e94646;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .day:nth-child(1) i { height: 34px; }
        .day:nth-child(2) i { height: 42px; }
        .day:nth-child(3) i { height: 30px; }
        .day:nth-child(4) i { height: 48px; }
        .day:nth-child(5) i { height: 36px; }

        .phone-nav {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 2px;
            padding: 8px 12px 13px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2ece7;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
        }

        .phone-nav span {
            text-align: center;
            color: #5e7069;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .phone-nav b {
            display: block;
            width: 26px;
            height: 23px;
            margin: 0 auto 3px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #edf7f3;
            color: #087a59;
        }

        .hero-copy {
            max-width: 620px;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 34px;
            padding: 0 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 22px 0 16px;
            max-width: 680px;
            font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px);
            line-height: 1.04;
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .lead {
            max-width: 575px;
            margin: 0 0 28px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .download-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .store-button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-height: 54px;
            padding: 0 22px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #0f1f19;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(6, 79, 61, 0.26);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .store-button.secondary {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .store-button.disabled {
            pointer-events: none;
            background: #80968e;
            color: #eef7f3;
        }

        .store-icon {
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .store-button.secondary .store-icon {
            background: var(--green-soft);
        }

        .status {
            margin-top: 18px;
            color: <%= apkAvailable ? "#dbfff0" : "#ffe1e1" %>;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
            margin: 46px auto 74px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 660px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            margin: 0 0 9px;
            font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .section-title p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .app-card {
            min-height: 238px;
            padding: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.08);
        }

        .app-card .icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--green-soft);
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .app-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .app-card p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.55;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .card-link {
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .desktop-note {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        @media (max-width: 940px) {
            .hero-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 36px;
                padding-top: 18px;
                padding-bottom: 112px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .hero-copy {
                margin: 0 auto;
                order: -1;
            }

            .lead, h1 { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
            .download-row { justify-content: center; }
            .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .wrap, .content { width: min(100% - 26px, 1120px); }
            .brand-bar { min-height: 76px; }
            .brand span { white-space: normal; }
            .hero-grid { padding-bottom: 86px; }
            .store-button { width: 100%; }
            .phone-shell { width: min(326px, 100%); }
            .phone-screen { min-height: auto; }
            .content { margin-top: 34px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <% const safeStats = stats || {}; %>
    <% const totalStudents = safeStats.totalStudents || 0; %>
    <% const presentToday = safeStats.presentToday || 0; %>
    <% const attendanceRate = totalStudents ? Math.min(100, Math.round((presentToday / Math.max(totalStudents, 1)) * 100)) : 0; %>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="brand-bar">
                <a class="brand" href="/app" aria-label="Open Edutrack">
                    <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="Edutrack Logo">
                    <span>
                        <strong>Edutrack</strong>
                        <span>Schools Division of Sipalay City</span>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="phone-shell" aria-label="Edutrack mobile dashboard preview">
                    <div class="phone-screen">
                        <div class="phone-header">
                            <div class="phone-brand">
                                <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="phone-title">Edutrack Dashboard</div>
                                    <div class="phone-subtitle">Schools Division of Sipalay City</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="phone-chip-row">
                                <span class="phone-chip"><i class="live-dot"></i>LIVE</span>
                                <span class="phone-chip"><%= safeStats.today || '' %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="phone-body">
                            <div class="greeting-card">
                                <small>Good day</small>
                                <strong>Division Monitoring</strong>
                                <small>Live attendance and absence alerts</small>
                            </div>

                            <div class="summary-card">
                                <div class="ring" style="--rate:<%= attendanceRate %>%"><span><%= attendanceRate %>%</span></div>
                                <div class="mini-grid">
                                    <div class="mini-stat"><b><%= safeStats.totalSchools || 0 %></b><span>Schools</span></div>
                                    <div class="mini-stat"><b><%= totalStudents %></b><span>Students</span></div>
                                    <div class="mini-stat"><b><%= presentToday %></b><span>Present</span></div>
                                    <div class="mini-stat"><b><%= safeStats.absentToday || 0 %></b><span>Absent</span></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="alert-card">
                                <div class="alert-icon">!</div>
                                <div>
                                    <strong>2-Day Absence Alerts</strong>
                                    <span>Tap a flagged student to contact the adviser.</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="weekly-card">
                                <div class="weekly-title">
                                    <span>Weekly Absence Analytics</span>
                                    <span>Mon-Fri</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bars">
                                    <span class="day">Mon<i>1</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Tue<i>2</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Wed<i>1</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Thu<i>3</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Fri<i>1</i></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="phone-nav">
                            <span><b>H</b>Home</span>
                            <span><b>A</b>Attend</span>
                            <span><b>S</b>Schools</span>
                            <span><b>R</b>Report</span>
                            <span><b>!</b>Alerts</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span>Live Edutrack apps</div>
                    <h1>The attendance system in your pocket and on your desktop.</h1>
                    <p class="lead">Download the Edutrack app for mobile or desktop access to the same QR attendance records, live dashboards, absence alerts, reports, school data, and adviser contact tools connected to the Railway server.</p>
                    <div class="download-row">
                        <a class="store-button <%= apkAvailable ? '' : 'disabled' %>" href="/download/mobile-app" download>
                            <span class="store-icon">A</span>
                            Download iOS and Android App
                        </a>
                        <a class="store-button secondary" href="/download/desktop-app" download>
                            <span class="store-icon">D</span>
                            Download Desktop App
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status">
                        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                            <%= error %>
                        <% } else if (apkAvailable) { %>
                            Mobile and desktop downloads are ready for this attendance system.
                        <% } else { %>
                            Desktop launcher is ready. Build the APK and place it in public/downloads/school-attendance-division.apk.
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main id="apps" class="content">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Choose Your Edutrack App</h2>
            <p>Use the same account and same Railway-hosted database whether you open Edutrack on mobile, desktop, or the browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
            <article class="app-card">
                <div class="icon">A</div>
                <h3>Mobile App</h3>
                <p>Install the latest mobile app package for dashboards, alerts, school lists, reports, and native adviser contact actions.</p>
                <a class="card-link <%= apkAvailable ? '' : 'disabled' %>" href="/download/mobile-app" download>Download mobile app</a>
            </article>
            <article class="app-card">
                <div class="icon">D</div>
                <h3>Desktop App</h3>
                <p>Download the Windows launcher to open Edutrack as a focused desktop window using the same secure web system.</p>
                <a class="card-link" href="/download/desktop-app" download>Download desktop app</a>
                <div class="desktop-note">Works best with Microsoft Edge or Google Chrome.</div>
            </article>
            <article class="app-card">
                <div class="icon">P</div>
                <h3>Browser Install</h3>
                <p>Supported desktop browsers can install Edutrack as a standalone app with the same account and live database.</p>
                <button class="card-link" type="button" data-install-desktop style="border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;cursor:pointer;">Install from browser</button>
            </article>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        let deferredInstallPrompt = null;
        const installButtons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-install-desktop]');

        window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt', (event) => {
            event.preventDefault();
            deferredInstallPrompt = event;
        });

        installButtons.forEach((button) => {
            button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
                if (!deferredInstallPrompt) {
                    window.location.href = '/download/desktop-app';
                    return;
                }
                deferredInstallPrompt.prompt();
                await deferredInstallPrompt.userChoice;
                deferredInstallPrompt = null;
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
